<p class="eyebrow">Password reset</p>
<h1>Choose a new password.</h1>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password for <strong><%= @resource.email %></strong> at <%= @resource.organization.name %>.</p>
<p class="button-wrap"><a class="button" href="<%= portal_url("/?reset_password_token=#{CGI.escape(@token)}") %>">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p class="muted">If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email; your password stays as it is.</p>
